## 7. GLOBAL ANIMATION SYSTEM — GSAP FIRST

Use GSAP as the main orchestration system for application-level animation.

Reference:
https://github.com/greensock/GSAP

Use the existing installation if present. Install only what is required.

### Shared animation utilities

Create reusable animation utilities for:
