### Page transitions

On navigation:
- Transition the main content using a restrained opacity and vertical movement.
- Avoid unnecessarily delaying access to new content.
- Preserve focus management.
- Do not animate the entire page if doing so causes visible flicker or accessibility problems.

### Cards and panels

Use meaningful animation patterns:
- Stagger cards when a section first appears.
- Elevate the hovered card slightly.
- Illuminate its border subtly.
- Reveal additional information when the user interacts.
- Animate numbers only when the underlying values are real and the animation improves comprehension.
