### Buttons

- Emerald primary actions.
- Refined glow on hover.
- Subtle press feedback.
- Clear keyboard focus.
- Disabled state without misleading glow.

### Icons

Animate selected icons only when their interaction benefits from feedback. Do not continuously pulse every icon.

### Ambient background

Use restrained movement behind the interface, not on top of important content.

Never allow decorative elements to obstruct text, charts, buttons, or focus rings.

